 forces to raise an army avenging their former lord. They nominated Yan Rou, a native of Yan, as Wuwan Jnr Minister of War, and he became one of the key members of the local You Province armed resistance against Gongsun Zan.","jp":"幽州牧・劉虞の部下。鮮于輔の同族。かつて命を受けて田疇とともに長安へ使者として赴き、献帝に拝謁した。劉虞が公孫瓚に殺害されると、鮮于輔や斉周らとともに州内の兵馬を集結させて旧主の仇を討つべく挙兵し、燕国出身の閻柔を烏丸司馬に推戴した。公孫瓚に対抗する幽州本土の武装勢力における中心人物の一人となった。","kr":"유주목 유우의 부하이자 선우보의 동족이다. 일찍이 명을 받아 전주와 함께 장안으로 가 한 헌제를 알현했다. 유우가 공손찬에게 살해당하자 선우보, 제주 등과 함께 주의 병마를 집결하여 옛 주군의 원수를 갚고자 거병하였으며, 연국 사람 염유를 오환사마로 추대했다. 공손찬에 대항하는 유주 토착 무장 세력의 핵심 일원 중 한 명이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1026415","remark":"","surname":"鲜于","surnameTc":"鮮于","surnameEn":"Xianyu","surnameJp":"鮮于","surnameKr":"선우","surnameOther":"","name":"银","nameTc":"銀","nameEn":"Yin","nameJp":"銀","nameKr":"은","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"鲜于银","power":"WJ10162","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1008","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"65","wise":"62","politics":"57","charm":"70","will":"80","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"66/65/18/21/18/49/32/18","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5900","battleSoulPoint":"5500","debateSoulPoint":"4300","strategy":"","strategy2":"1010201","professions":"0/2/3/2/0/0/2/2/1/1/2/2/1/2/0/1/1/1/2/1/1/0/3/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"26","loyalty":"100","reputation":"5800","evaluate":"1100","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"164","show":"184","death":"228","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":